{"3885330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kaminari", "steam_appid": 3885330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaminari is a First Person RPG set in a fantasy Feudal Japan, based on authentic depictions and real historical accounts. Choose your own path in this world filled with mysterious Yokai creatures, each one faithfully brought to life, and master a range of martial arts, from swords, to bows, to the humble wooden staff, or destroy your enemies with powerful magical talismans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/ec3ddabef7183397c84ee54a74514d89.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/ec3ddabef7183397c84ee54a74514d89.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/ec3ddabef7183397c84ee54a74514d89.mp4?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lure of the Yokai</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players may find themselves strangely drawn to the ferocious Yokai which inhabit the world of Yamato. They should be careful not to be drawn into any dark rituals, or they may find themselves serving the nefarious goals of new masters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/b59abf0c0d40d87c9355395bb6fa8eba.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/b59abf0c0d40d87c9355395bb6fa8eba.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/b59abf0c0d40d87c9355395bb6fa8eba.mp4?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Faction System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Yamato contains a multitude of Families, each with their own martial specialisation. Join them, and rise in the ranks to unlock deadly secret techniques; but be careful, you may find that your new allegiance comes with new enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/dacda554528d23889051008e4683d820.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/dacda554528d23889051008e4683d820.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/dacda554528d23889051008e4683d820.mp4?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaminari features full character customisation. Will you be a native Yamato, a mysterious foreign Nanban, an aquatic Kappa, or something else? An old-school class system lets you shape your character from the start, while unlockable perks will allow you to hone them as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/a6b04bfd8fde2b3dc6f14f4f694535bf.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/a6b04bfd8fde2b3dc6f14f4f694535bf.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talisman Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic in Kaminari is based on Talismans. Throw wooden talismans your enemies for ranged attacks, or use paper talismans for melee attacks, sticking them to your enemies to cause effects over time. Special talismans may also be used to summon Yokai and Kami to fight alongside you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Crime System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrong side of the law is the fun side. Players who choose to embrace a life of crime will find an advanced crime system, in which witnesses report both criminal and suspicious behaviour. If you have enough suspicion on you around a crime scene, you may find yourself called to a tribunal to answer for your misdeeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaminari is a First Person RPG set in a fantasy Feudal Japan, based on authentic depictions and real historical accounts. Choose your own path in this world filled with mysterious Yokai creatures, each one faithfully brought to life, and master a range of martial arts, from swords, to bows, to the humble wooden staff, or destroy your enemies with powerful magical talismans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/ec3ddabef7183397c84ee54a74514d89.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/ec3ddabef7183397c84ee54a74514d89.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/ec3ddabef7183397c84ee54a74514d89.mp4?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lure of the Yokai</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players may find themselves strangely drawn to the ferocious Yokai which inhabit the world of Yamato. They should be careful not to be drawn into any dark rituals, or they may find themselves serving the nefarious goals of new masters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/b59abf0c0d40d87c9355395bb6fa8eba.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/b59abf0c0d40d87c9355395bb6fa8eba.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/b59abf0c0d40d87c9355395bb6fa8eba.mp4?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Faction System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Yamato contains a multitude of Families, each with their own martial specialisation. Join them, and rise in the ranks to unlock deadly secret techniques; but be careful, you may find that your new allegiance comes with new enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/dacda554528d23889051008e4683d820.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/dacda554528d23889051008e4683d820.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/dacda554528d23889051008e4683d820.mp4?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaminari features full character customisation. Will you be a native Yamato, a mysterious foreign Nanban, an aquatic Kappa, or something else? An old-school class system lets you shape your character from the start, while unlockable perks will allow you to hone them as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/a6b04bfd8fde2b3dc6f14f4f694535bf.poster.avif?t=1759492676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/extras/a6b04bfd8fde2b3dc6f14f4f694535bf.webm?t=1759492676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talisman Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic in Kaminari is based on Talismans. Throw wooden talismans your enemies for ranged attacks, or use paper talismans for melee attacks, sticking them to your enemies to cause effects over time. Special talismans may also be used to summon Yokai and Kami to fight alongside you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Crime System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrong side of the law is the fun side. Players who choose to embrace a life of crime will find an advanced crime system, in which witnesses report both criminal and suspicious behaviour. If you have enough suspicion on you around a crime scene, you may find yourself called to a tribunal to answer for your misdeeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore a fantasy feudal Japan, teeming with authentic Yokai creatures. Build your own character, choosing a race, class, and combat abilities. Learn the way of the sword, master the elements through magical talismans, or become a master marksman in Kaminari.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/a9500934ef76cfe66a63a48f28c60680e6a49efa/header.jpg?t=1759492676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/9612c4b137d4e5c798d8794eafe2ab2e767cc648/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759492676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885330/9612c4b137d4e5c798d8794eafe2ab2e767cc648/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759492676", "website": "https://discord.gg/tJbmZZggSz", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 8th Gen / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 13th gen / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Oliver Josh"], "publishers": ["Jorgen Games Ltd."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https